{"n": 5335, "src": "Většina se rozhodla zvednout ruce pro nový plán.", "en": "The majority chose to raise their hands for the new plan.", "lk_supplied": "to raise", "topic": "Gerund vs Infinitive", "level": "B1", "person": "3sg", "number": "sg", "perfective_present": false}
{"n": 5336, "src": "Kdyby si koupil vlastní powerbanku, nepotřeboval by její pomoc na každém výletě.", "en": "If he bought his own power bank, he wouldn't need her help on every trip.", "lk_supplied": "bought", "topic": "2. Conditional", "level": "B1", "person": "3sg", "number": "sg", "perfective_present": false}
{"n": 5337, "src": "Než odejdou z parku, powerbanka nabije jeho telefon na sto procent.", "en": "By the time they leave the park, the power bank will have charged his phone to a hundred per cent.", "lk_supplied": "will have charged", "topic": "Future Perfect Simple", "level": "B2", "person": null, "number": null, "perfective_present": true}
{"n": 5338, "src": "Černá kočka se nehýbe a bílá taky ne — úplné sochy.", "en": "The black cat isn't moving, and neither is the white one — total statues.", "lk_supplied": "neither", "topic": "So, Neither, Nor", "level": "B1", "person": null, "number": null, "perfective_present": null}
{"n": 5339, "src": "O těch dvou kočkách se říká, že jsou nejfotografovanější dvojice na pobřeží.", "en": "The two cats are said to be the most photographed pair on this whole shore.", "lk_supplied": "are said", "topic": "Advanced Passive Voice", "level": "B2", "person": null, "number": null, "perfective_present": null}
{"n": 5340, "src": "Kdyby stopy byly starší, teď by to vzdali.", "en": "If the tracks were older, they would give up now.", "lk_supplied": "were", "topic": "2. Conditional", "level": "B1", "person": "3pl", "number": "pl", "perfective_present": false}
{"n": 5341, "src": "Bláto bylo hluboké; přesto, drželi se stopy.", "en": "The mud was deep; nevertheless, they kept on the trail.", "lk_supplied": "nevertheless", "topic": "Advanced linkers", "level": "B2", "person": "3sg", "number": "sg", "perfective_present": false}
{"n": 5342, "src": "Stará konvice stojí na modrém plameni.", "en": "The old kettle stands on the blue flame.", "lk_supplied": "on", "topic": "Prepositions of place/time", "level": "A1", "person": null, "number": null, "perfective_present": false}
{"n": 5343, "src": "Podívej! Plyn právě plápolá modrým plamenem.", "en": "Look! The gas is burning with a blue flame.", "lk_supplied": "is burning", "topic": "Present Continuous", "level": "A2", "person": null, "number": null, "perfective_present": null}
{"n": 5344, "src": "Tenhle krokodýl leze z vody.", "en": "This crocodile is coming out of the water.", "lk_supplied": "This", "topic": "This, That, These...", "level": "A1", "person": "3sg", "number": "sg", "perfective_present": false}
{"n": 5345, "src": "Dneska plave a včera tu plaval taky.", "en": "It swims today, and it swam here yesterday too.", "lk_supplied": "swam", "topic": "Present or Past Simple", "level": "A2", "person": "3sg", "number": "sg", "perfective_present": false}
{"n": 5346, "src": "Ze všech součástek ve stroji ozubené kolo, které namontoval jako poslední, bylo největší.", "en": "Of all the parts in the machine, the gear he fitted last was the biggest.", "lk_supplied": "the gear", "topic": "Articles advanced", "level": "B2", "person": "3sg", "number": "sg", "perfective_present": false}
{"n": 5347, "src": "To moře má vysoké vlny a bílé skály.", "en": "The sea has got high waves and white rocks.", "lk_supplied": "has got", "topic": "HAVE GOT", "level": "A1", "person": "3sg", "number": "sg", "perfective_present": false}
{"n": 5348, "src": "Moře je slané, ale plavou v něm celý den.", "en": "The sea is salty, but they swim in it all day.", "lk_supplied": "but", "topic": "Basic conjunctions", "level": "A2", "person": "3sg", "number": "sg", "perfective_present": false}
{"n": 5349, "src": "Jestli bude pršet víc, Tom si natáhne kapuci a poběží dál.", "en": "If it rains harder, Tom will pull his hood up and keep going anyway.", "lk_supplied": "will pull", "topic": "1. Conditional", "level": "B1", "person": "3sg", "number": "sg", "perfective_present": true}
{"n": 5350, "src": "Tom netušil, že se jeho lehký ranní běh změní v každodenní zvyk.", "en": "Tom had no idea that his easy morning jog would turn into a daily habit.", "lk_supplied": "would turn", "topic": "Future in past", "level": "B2", "person": null, "number": null, "perfective_present": null}
{"n": 5351, "src": "Číšník je oblečený ve formální uniformě s černým motýlkem.", "en": "The waiter is dressed in a formal uniform with a black bow tie.", "lk_supplied": "is dressed", "topic": "Passive or Active", "level": "B1", "person": "3sg", "number": "sg", "perfective_present": false}
{"n": 5352, "src": "Co má ona nejdřív na sobě? Džínovou bundu.", "en": "What does she wear first? A denim jacket.", "lk_supplied": "What", "topic": "Wh- questions", "level": "A1", "person": null, "number": null, "perfective_present": false}
{"n": 5353, "src": "Skvělá volba, samozřejmě. Příště ona si vezme ten klobouk s peřím do práce.", "en": "Great choice, obviously. Next time she will wear the feathered hat to work.", "lk_supplied": "will wear", "topic": "Future with WILL", "level": "A2", "person": "1pl", "number": "pl", "perfective_present": true}
{"n": 5354, "src": "Holka, řekl mi, že než dorazili na vrchol, pot mu už stekl do očí.", "en": "Girl, he told me the sweat had run into his eyes by the time they reached the top.", "lk_supplied": "had run", "topic": "Past Perfect Simple", "level": "B1", "person": "3sg", "number": "sg", "perfective_present": false}
{"n": 5355, "src": "Prádlo, žehlicí prkno, žehlička: pro tu ženu je to nabitý den.", "en": "Laundry, ironing board, iron: it is a busy day for the woman.", "lk_supplied": "a", "topic": "A, AN, THE", "level": "A1", "person": "3sg", "number": "sg", "perfective_present": false}
{"n": 5356, "src": "Hele, řekla mi, že zaneprázdněná žena by měla si dát pauzu.", "en": "Listen, she told me a busy woman should take a break.", "lk_supplied": "should", "topic": "Modal verb SHOULD", "level": "A2", "person": "3sg", "number": "sg", "perfective_present": false}
{"n": 5357, "src": "Teď má svobodu, tak si myslím, že on bude svobodný.", "en": "He has freedom now, so I think he will be free.", "lk_supplied": "will be", "topic": "Going to or Will", "level": "A2", "person": "1sg", "number": "sg", "perfective_present": false}
{"n": 5358, "src": "Kdy jde pomalá želva? Ve dne v noci.", "en": "When does the slow tortoise walk? Day and night.", "lk_supplied": "When", "topic": "Wh- questions", "level": "A1", "person": null, "number": null, "perfective_present": true}
{"n": 5359, "src": "Kámo, želva jde tak pomalu, nic moc, ale vyhrává.", "en": "Dude, the tortoise walks so slowly, kinda mid but it wins.", "lk_supplied": "slowly", "topic": "Adverb formation", "level": "A2", "person": null, "number": null, "perfective_present": true}
{"n": 5360, "src": "Při východu slunce dosáhla vrcholu a její kamarádka taky.", "en": "She reached the summit at sunrise, and so did her friend.", "lk_supplied": "so did her friend.", "topic": "So, Neither, Nor", "level": "B1", "person": "3sg", "number": "sg", "perfective_present": false}
{"n": 5361, "src": "Tahle růžová láhev jde do boční kapsy.", "en": "This pink bottle goes into the side pocket.", "lk_supplied": "This", "topic": "This, That, These...", "level": "A1", "person": null, "number": null, "perfective_present": null}
{"n": 5362, "src": "Podívej! Právě teď balí penál.", "en": "Look! She is packing her pencil pouch right now.", "lk_supplied": "is packing", "topic": "Present Continuous", "level": "A2", "person": "3sg", "number": "sg", "perfective_present": false}
{"n": 5363, "src": "Žilky listu sleduje jedním prstem.", "en": "He touches the veins of the leaf with one finger.", "lk_supplied": "touches", "topic": "Present Simple", "level": "A1", "person": "3sg", "number": "sg", "perfective_present": false}
{"n": 5364, "src": "Zůstaň tu a uvidíš deštník z listu.", "en": "Stay here and you will see a leaf umbrella.", "lk_supplied": "will see", "topic": "Future with WILL", "level": "A2", "person": "2sg", "number": "sg", "perfective_present": null}
